      <p>Little Grattan Street runs south off Grattan Street, near the intersection of Grattan and Swanston streets.</p>
      <p>See the State Library Victoria catalogue entry to have a glimpse of Little Grattan Street and the 'slums' there. <ref target="https://viewer.slv.vic.gov.au/?entity=IE724317&amp;mode=browse">https://viewer.slv.vic.gov.au/?entity=IE724317&amp;mode=browse</ref></p>
